5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I worry about our quarter-end reporting. We need to know if new holdings complicate our audits.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I want to verify if our past wins actually retained customers or just churned quietly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I need to understand our borrowing capacity. What can we leverage if follow-on calls hit hard?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I am tired of chasing recruiters. I need to see who is actually available to hire right now.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am concerned about external blockers. I want to see what stopped previous deployments from going live.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, if we take on complex assets, does our credit line hold up?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, if deployments were delayed, did we even know why? Transparency is key.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, yes, but only if the underlying assets are liquid. I need to check the terms.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, retention is good, but if we can't staff the team, it doesn't matter.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, I suspect the delays were not internal. I need to see the external factors.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will look into the audit needs and the independent checks on our figures.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check account retention and the profile of our exits to see the truth.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will investigate the credit line terms and the reserve accounts for follow-on calls.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will look at the retained recruiters' times and the adviser bench to see our capacity.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the security review time and the delivery records of our two holdings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us see what the data says. I trust the numbers, but only if they are clean.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. I am done with the stories. I want the raw data on who stayed.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minako,,I am ready. I need to know exactly how much air we have before the next call.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mio,,I am excited to see if we can actually find people. I am tired of the empty promises.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I am waiting. I need to know if the road is blocked before we drive onto it.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
