35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The audit findings are clear. Physical assets need outside appraisals, which slows us down and costs money.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Asuka,,My data confirms it. The tooling that stayed was boring. The one that failed was physical.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,"This is bad. Our credit line ignores our contracts. We are borrowing against stock, not our work.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,"I found the gap. We can hire support fast, but we cannot find the people who run the yard.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The pattern is clear. The delay was not our code. It was the hardware and the bank's rules.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, if we take on more physical assets, our quarter-end will be a nightmare.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, so the risk is not the software. It is the stuff that sits in a warehouse.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, exactly. We need to avoid anything that requires a physical appraisal to secure a loan.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, that matches my finding. We have the bench for software, but not for the field.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, yes. The bank's cycle was safe. The hardware was the trap. I want to avoid the trap.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,I am leaning toward a pure software model. It is verifiable and does not need an outside appraiser.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. The retention data shows that the boring, back-office tools are the ones that actually pay.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,I am convinced. We need a model that does not tie up our cash in physical inventory.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,"I am on board. If we pick a software company, I can actually find the people to run it.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I am aligned. I want a model where the first customer can switch on without waiting for a truck.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us wait for the candidates. I am ready to vote for the one that keeps our books clean.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I am ready. I want to see which one looks like the quiet tooling that survived.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minako,,I am ready. I need to see which one lets us keep our borrowing power intact.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,I am ready. I want to see which one I can actually staff without losing my mind.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I am ready. I want to see which one has no external blockers between the money and the first switch.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
